# Runtime / simulation outputs (do not archive)
logs/
m5out*/
**/m5out*/

# Build / harness binaries and object files
**/run.exe
**/a.out
harness/**/src/*.o
harness/**/src/*.o.*
harness/**/src/obj
harness/**/*.elf
harness/**/bin/
harness/**/*.bin

